<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="command">knee</ansi>

<ansi fg="command">knee</ansi> is an alias for <ansi fg="command">kick</ansi>. When you are in
a clinch or ground grapple and have control, the kick command
automatically becomes a knee strike.

See <ansi fg="command">help kick</ansi> for full details on all three variants
(kick, stomp, knee).
